// I Can See Clearly Now (Johnny Nash 1972)

Tempo 124
Keysig G

Groove Metronome2-4
   z * 2
   
Transpose Up Perfect 4

// Since we are transposing up quite a bit we
// drop the ocatve of the CleanGuitar and to
// make it more mellow we increase the duration.
// Arpeggio is used in the PLUS versions.
Begin AllTracks Arpeggio
    Articulate 120
    Octave 4
End

Label DS
Repeat

Groove  R&B-Ballad
Volume m

1         G
2         C
3         G
4         /

Groove  R&B-BalladPlus
Volume f

5         /
6         C
7         D
8         /

Groove  R&B-Ballad
Volume m

9         G
10        C
11        G
12        /

Groove  R&B-BalladPlus
Cresc f 4
13        F
14        C
15        G

If Def CODA
  GoTo CODA
EndIf

RepeatEnding

16        /

Groove  R&B-Ballad

17        F
18        C
19        G

Groove R&B-BalladFill

20        /

RepeatEnd

Groove R&B-BalladFill

21        /

Groove  R&B-BalladSus

22       Bb
23        /
24        F
25        /

Groove  R&B-BalladSusPlus

26       Bb
27        /
28        D
29        /

Groove R&B-BalladSus

30      F#m
31        C
32      F#m
33        C

Groove R&B-BalladSusPlus

34        F
35        G
36        D

Groove R&B-BalladFill

37        /

// this is the DS al Coda
Set CODA
Goto DS

Label CODA

Decresc p 8
Repeat
Groove R&B-Ballad

38        G
39        F
40        C

RepeatEnding

41        G

RepeatEnd

Groove R&B-BalladEnd
Decresc ppp 2
Tempo *.9 2

42        G
43       C6      /      G

